{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8b4d6006945d280a17b","chatId":"ea8fe6b784de4a9289ecdb23ae609116","sessionId":null,"userId":68437,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1007,"promptTokens":1466,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:56"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218626796758749,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8b4d6006945d280a179","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369716382,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8b4d6006945d280a179","chatId":"ea8fe6b784de4a9289ecdb23ae609116","sessionId":null,"userId":68437,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n安德烈在一个认为被雨淋湿是冒险而有趣的活动的地方长大。今天，尽管下着雨，她没有带伞就走去上班，结果浑身湿透，也没有衣服可换。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，安德烈最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 激动\nB) 失望\nC) 气恼\nD) 不关心\nE) 紧张\nF) 反感\n\n## 问题 2\n安德烈为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 因为她的文化影响，她喜欢被雨淋得湿透\nB) 她被淋得湿透，只能穿着湿衣服工作\nC) 她把雨伞忘在了宿舍\nD) 她没带多余的衣服可换","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218626796758749,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8b4d6006945d280a17b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369716380,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2418975833ab41b4b3a5743be35d1c2b"}